WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
This is MarkNote.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.200
Markdown, set like a Word document.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.000
Free, for Windows.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.800
Write Markdown on the left, and the finished page
appears on the right as you type.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.100
The file stays plain text.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.700
Prefer to work the Word way?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.400
Type straight into the page, and use the ribbon
for bold, highlights and lists.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.600
Right-click, and you get a menu just like Word's.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.400
Turn a paragraph into a heading with one click.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.500
Paste from Word, Google Docs or the web,

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.800
and choose whether to keep the formatting,
or paste plain text.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.900
Diagrams don't need code.

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:51.700
Add steps, pick a shape and a colour,
and label the arrows.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.700
The diagram is drawn while you work,

00:00:56.850 --> 00:01:01.300
and it's saved as Mermaid, so it also shows up
on GitHub and in other Markdown tools.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:08.800
Tables, pictures, formulas and footnotes
are one click away on the Insert tab.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:14.400
Open a Word document,
and MarkNote turns it into clean Markdown.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.800
When you're done, export to a real Word document,

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:24.100
a PDF, a web page, or keep it in Markdown.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.700
Diagrams included.

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:31.900
Find and replace works across the whole document,
with regular expressions when you need them.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.700
Reading mode shows your document as a clean page.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.050
And you can choose a light, dark,
sepia or Word Blue theme,

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.000
whatever suits your eyes.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:55.000
MarkNote speaks 13 languages,
and follows your Windows setting.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:00.000
MarkNote is free and open source.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:02.300
Download it today.
